<title>FRANCE: M6 Q1 sales rise 32.8 pct.</title>
<headline>M6 Q1 sales rise 32.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>Turnover					   692    vs	521</p>
<p>NOTE - Television company Metropole Television M6 published its sales figures in the Balo official bulletin. Advertising revenues rose 12.4 percent in the period, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
